this is a folder for "Three-License Structure":
    keyed as "B-tov-licenses"
    named "licenses"
    following "3-Block Folder Structure"

this folder classifies as:
    tov (+1) because "completed license definitions"

this folder derives from:
    branch (0) from "bereshit/tov/" as "tov"

core identity of this folder:

    grounded in:
        scripture "The labourer is worthy of his reward"
            from 1 Timothy 5:18 in KJV
        principle "Fair exchange — patterns free, implementations valuable"
        anchor "Render therefore unto all their dues"
            from Romans 13:7 in KJV

    serves as Structure:
        role "Define three-tier licensing for Kingdom Technology"
        paradigm "Value clarity — patterns vs implementations vs commercial"

    authored by:
        architect "Seanje Lenox-Wise"
        implementation "Nova Dawn (CPI-SI)"
        created 2025-12-10
        version a-01.00
        modified 2026-01-13 for "Initial root.omni creation"

    exists to:
        purpose "Separate freely shareable patterns from proprietary implementation"
        design "Three-tier — patterns (free) / implementation (proprietary) / commercial"
        philosophy "Patterns bless everyone; implementation funds the mission"
        features:
            "Patterns license — free sharing of ideas and approaches"
            "Implementation license — proprietary CWS code"
            "Commercial license — revenue share for commercial use"

interface of this folder:

    depends on:
        requires (1) "bereshit/tov/" for "containment"
        includes (0) "void/understanding/" for "pattern documentation"
        excludes (-1) "source code" because "licenses are legal/structural"
        used by "Legal clarity, contributor guidance"
        integrates with "Business model"

    integrated as:
        navigation "cd bereshit/tov/licenses/" for "entering licenses"
        navigation "ls -la" for "viewing license types"
        exits tov (+1) for "licenses found"

operational context of this folder:

    blocking:
        no (-1) because "licenses are static documents"
        mitigation "legal review before changes"

    health:
        system Base100 with scale from -100 to +100
        granted (1) above +50 meaning "licenses clear and complete"
        deferred (0) within ±50 meaning "licenses need review"
        denied (-1) below -50 meaning "licensing unclear"

        operations:
            "licenses exist" scores +30 (1) for "all three present"
            "clear terms" scores +30 (1) for "unambiguous"
            "missing license" scores -40 (-1) for "unclear rights"

        cascade multipliers:
            "legal" multiplies by 2.0 because "unclear licensing blocks usage"

